  "content": "<center>\n\t<img style=\"width: 1142px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/wordmarks/outlined/cracked/f64_wordmark.png\">\n\t<h1>Minecraft 64x纹理资源包的首选。</h1>\n\t<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/addons/faithful-64x-bedrock\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/bedrock_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"获取基岩版资源包\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n</center>\n<hr>\n<p>\n    提升Minecraft纹理分辨率的合理下一步。与Faithful 32x一样，本资源包基于默认美术风格——以四倍分辨率精心重制，并恰到好处地添加额外细节，为您带来完美的原版风格Minecraft体验。\n\t<br><br>\n    由于纹理直接基于其32x版本制作，因此包与包之间保持了高度一致性，且品质不断提升。\\\n    如果您喜欢高细节资源包但仍想保留原版感觉，这款资源包就是为您准备的！\n\n</p>\n<center>\n\t<a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img style=\"width: 1142px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/discord_button.png\" alt=\"Discord服务器\">\n\t</a>\n  <br><br>\n\t<a href=\"https://faithfulpack.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img style=\"width: 1142px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/website_button.png\" alt=\"官方网站\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n<hr>\n<center><h2>补充信息：</h2></center>\n<p>\n    如果您有任何反馈、想报告bug或需要帮助，请加入我们上方的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Discord</a>服务器，提出\n\t<a href=\"https://github.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Faithful-64x-Java/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub issue</a>，\n    或在下方评论。有关商业或分发问题，请参阅我们的\n\t<a href=\"http://faithfulpack.net/license\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">许可证</a>。\n\t<br><br>\n    所有纹理和附加组件均由志愿者利用空闲时间贡献提供。任何人都可以通过我们上面链接的Discord服务器提交纹理，或制作\n\t<a href=\"http://faithfulpack.net/addons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">附加组件</a>\n    以便在我们的网站上正式列出。在开始之前，请务必阅读我们的\n\t<a href=\"https://docs.faithfulpack.net/pages/textures/f64-texturing-guidelines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">纹理制作指南</a>，\n    其中精确概述了本资源包的美术风格。\n\t<br><br>\n    每个资源包均可在我们的<a href=\"faithfulpack.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">网站</a>、\n\t<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/faithful_resource_pack/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CurseForge</a>、\n\t<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/faithful_resource_pack/submissions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Planet Minecraft</a>、\n    和<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Faithful-Resource-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Modrinth</a>上找到，部分资源包还额外在\n\t<a href=\"https://mcpedl.com/user/faithful-resource-pack/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MCPEDL</a>和\n\t<a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/Faithful_Resource_Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Minecraft论坛</a>上列出。\n\t<strong>从其他任何网站下载均为非官方、不受支持且可能存在风险！</strong>\n    请务必在上网时保持警惕。\n</p>\n<hr>\n<center><h2>我们的其他项目：</h2></center>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n\t<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/faithful-32x\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/f32_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Faithful 32x\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n\t<br><br>\n\t<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/classic-faithful-32x-programmer-art\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Classic Faithful 32x\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n\t<br><br>\n\t<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/classic-faithful-32x-jappa\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32j_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Classic Faithful 32x Jappa\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n\t<br><br>\n\t<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf64j_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Classic Faithful 64x Jappa\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n</div>",
